{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u201c NEONPIXEL - Mixed Tile Assets\u201d consist of a diverse mix of various assets, each designed for creating distinct small to medium levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These include a spooky outdoor level, a wooded outdoor environment, and an abandoned garden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The last asset is particularly well-suited for crafting a fantasy Mushroom village with an emphasis on the outdoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All these levels come to life with dynamic animations that lights up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tilesets: 14 sheets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animations+fx: 18sheets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbThis pack is for use in RPG Maker Series or the engine of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbOK to be used in Commercial projects made in RPG Maker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbYou may modify some of the assets (but not redistribute them) for your own game use only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2864970?t=1739352126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2864970?t=1739352126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739352126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739352126","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \u201c NEONPIXEL - Mixed Tile Assets\u201d consist of a diverse mix of various assets, each designe